WEBVTT

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.440
Thanks and good job today!

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.440
Good job!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.900
I’m hungry!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.830
What should I do…

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.290
What’s the matter, Ichigo-san?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.750
I promised to visit the library during the weekend with Aoyama-kun.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.150
That’s something to be happy about.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.620
But I don’t have a dress I can wear.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.990
What should I do?

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:39.870
I don’t think dad will buy me a new dress until he gets his salary.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:43.730
Then ask Minto-oneechan
to let you borrow one.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.440
I don’t mind…

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.090
Thank you. ~nya!

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:59.020
Can I go to your house today?

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.250
I did say you can come to my house,

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.380
but why are you two coming too?

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:14.610
Because, your house is large, looks like a castle, and seems like lots of fun!

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:15.320
Right?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:15.840
Yes.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.370
Alright, let’s go explore!

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:23.420
YEAH!

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.440
Geez…

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:39.500
Miss Minto, welcome back!..

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.990
Welcome back!..

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.180
Woww!

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.960
This REALLY is a castle.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.480
Welcome back, Miss.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.190
I brought my friends over.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:52.900
Good evening!

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.660
Hi, a very warm welcome to you all!

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.040
Who is that cool guy?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.830
Yeah, he’s really cool!

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.090
Is he your brother?

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.640
Oniisama,

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:17.070
…these are my friends.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.110
Please excuse me, I’m busy.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:28.290
Goodbye, Young Master Seiji.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.940
That was cold.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.200
Ichigo-san!

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.910
Well… Let’s go to my room now.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.360
You may pick whichever
one you want.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.620
Wow!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.680
This closet might be larger
than my room!

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.060
Wuaaaahh! All of these are cute!

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.450
Which should I pick…

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.050
Rolly rolly rolly rolly.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.370
Minto, can I borrow this one?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.540
Oh, you may.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.130
Thanks a lot.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.550
Minto, is your brother in high school?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:37.480
He doesn’t go to high school since he’s going to study abroad.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.450
Oh, then you’re going to become lonely then.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.220
Please don’t talk about my brother.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.740
We try not to interfere with each other even if we’re siblings.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:49.900
Sorry.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:51.850
Yes?

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:55.190
Excuse me, I have prepared dinner.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:57.750
Everyone, please come
to the dining room.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.980
I trouble you again…

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.110
Haiii, let’s eat dinner!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.720
My my, Bu-Ling-san…

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.960
Please enjoy the food.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.990
These look so good.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.330
This is a large portion of pork!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.420
Today’s menu consists of beef fillet steamed with butter,

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:20.800
…a special sauce, side of artichokes, cold asparagus, cream soup with truffle,

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.180
…and for dessert we have strawberry shortcake,

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.910
and white peaches heated with wine.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:32.520
Come to think of it, don’t you eat dinner with your parents?

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:36.020
Her father is at a foreign country most of the time.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:40.820
And her mother is busy as well,
accompanying him.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.260
I don’t like to be with my family all the time.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.830
By the way, Miss Minto.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:57.000
How about inviting everyone to the ballet performance this weekend?

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.780
Wow, you learn ballet?
I love to see it.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.510
Bu-Ling going to ballet, too!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.880
Nice! Nice!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.510
You’re just riding a ball,
Bu-Ling-san.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:09.740
She’s a monkey.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.560
Then let’s invite them.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:16.920
You have been practicing for this big event for a year.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.730
I can’t wait!

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.670
I’m not doing this to
show it off to people.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.860
We can’t have that.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:29.750
You never ask anyone because you wish not to bother them, but for this event,

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:34.200
I am planning on inviting your father and Young Master Seiji…

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.580
DON’T DO THAT!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.670
Don’t ever do that!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.670
Miss!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:42.160
Also… it’s not something
to show an amateur.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.760
Excuse me.

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:53.470
I’m sorry, Miss gets stubborn when the topic of her family comes up.

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.980
Um, how do they get along?..

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:58.750
They were friendly siblings when they were young,

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:04.940
…but as they grew up, Master Seiji took the path of trying to become an elite.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:08.720
Miss Minto must have it rough for being compared to him.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:13.710
Everyone, please take care of her.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.940
A date?!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.090
On Sunday, there’s going to be an Edo craftsman gathering.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.250
It’s a traditional art. Cancel that and come with daddy…

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.260
No!!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:30.090
And? Where are you going to go on a date with Aoyama-kun?

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.590
The library.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:36.560
Come to think of it, we used to go on dates at the library when we were students.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.980
Really?

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.670
You kept bugging me,
“let’s go on a date”, Sakura.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.610
Not true. You were the one who invited me, Shin-chan.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:45.660
Whatever…

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.220
Sakura… {psstt…}

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:56.710
I wonder if Minto is always alone in that large house.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.640
Whatever.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.790
<i>Un deux trois.</i>

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.700
<i>Un deux trois.</i>

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:43.370
<i>Oniisama, I was selected
to be a prima donna.</i>

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:47.980
<i>You’re so lucky.
All you do is enjoy ballet.</i>

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:58.400
I’m not going to fall
behind you, Oniisama.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:17.070
Minto-san is going to take the day off to practice ballet.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.370
Hey, everyone.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:23.250
Let’s heighten the excitement at tomorrow’s performance by inviting Minto’s brother!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.170
What?

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:28.250
I think inside, Minto wants her brother to come.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.300
Count me in!

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.850
But Ichigo-san,

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:34.380
I thought you had a date tomorrow?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.160
Uh…

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.620
Shoot.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.980
Ichigo-san, pull yourself together!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.080
What’s the matter?

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.650
I hope the enemy doesn’t make a move again.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:52.260
I’ll do research around
the hall just in case.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.110
Sorry!

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:00.220
Tomorrow, I can’t make the date to the library.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.710
Don’t worry about it, Momomiya-san.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:05.130
I’m sure something more important came up.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:06.690
Aoyama-kun…

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:12.010
I… really really think of you importantly.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.640
But, tomorrow I really…

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.930
Don’t worry about it.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:20.930
You can see me anytime.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.440
Aoyama-kun…

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:29.460
[ Ikumi Ballet Group 2002 Performance ]

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:32.820
Ok, the plan is the same
as what I said yesterday.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.190
Leave it to me!

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.700
I’ll do my best!

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.290
Okay, I’ll see you all later.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.630
Now, I’m going to finish you all together for sure today.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:05.210
How was it?

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:08.340
They were saying that she has German class at 1pm,

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.260
…so she’s going to come out soon.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:15.880
There’s one more hour
to the performance.

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:27.070
You have become such a
beautiful prima donna.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:29.780
I would like to show this
to Young Master Seiji.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:33.320
Please let’s not discuss this.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.750
Excuse me.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.300
Hello? Retasu?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.010
How is it over there?

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.810
Yes, just as like you said, Ichigo-san…

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:04.980
I believe Minto-san wants her brother to see her perform.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.930
Yeah. I’ll take him there no matter what!

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:13.810
Huh?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:14.830
He’s here.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.570
We have to go.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:20.500
Excuse me! Minto’s brother!
I have something to talk about!..

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.290
Geez.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.840
Let’s go after him.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.460
Roger that!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.900
The car stopped at the light!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.490
Leave it to Bu-Ling!

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:59.200
Stop! Stop!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.830
Watch out!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:05.910
Thanks.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:08.450
Now I’m angry. Let’s…

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.750
Stop the car!

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.340
Don’t stop all of a sudden!

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.850
Yes, stop when I tell you to stop.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.270
Ichigo-neechan, you were amazing!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:28.970
Please listen, it’s Minto’s ballet performance today.

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:31.720
Please go watch it!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.940
We don’t have time for that.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.240
I know.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.860
Don’t you remember?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:45.290
Minto still treasures the picture of you applauding her when she was dancing.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.970
Even now, she carefully keeps it deep in her closet.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.850
Master Seiji, we will be late for the lecture if we don’t hurry.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:55.540
Yeah.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.010
Go.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:58.850
Ok!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.010
Hey, I’m not done!..

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:07.360
Wahh… I forgot that I was in the middle of an intersection!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:36.680
<i>We will now begin,
Ikumi Ballet Group’s 2002 performance.</i>

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:44.050
Retasu!

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:48.180
Ichigo-san, how did it go?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.940
Sorry, I let him get away.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.970
The enemy is tough.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:55.530
I’ve ruined everything.
I couldn’t do anything for Minto…

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.530
It’s not your fault.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.650
But…

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.990
Ichigo-san, Bu-Ling-san, look!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:01.820
Huh?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.300
I’ve to take a break once in a while.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.290
10 minutes till the show starts. Be ready.

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.560
Here, this way!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.810
Oniisama.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.520
We made it in time!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.770
What’s the matter? Be happy.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.100
Please don’t do anything unnecessary.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:40.780
But…

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.540
This is my family’s affair.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:45.410
You too, Oniisama.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.610
Now is a crucial period since you’re going to study abroad soon, please go home!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.410
You’re right.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.080
Wait, Minto…

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.840
Minto-oneechan!

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:58.620
Chimera Anima?!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.930
What the?

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.760
Hello, Ichigo.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.100
I came to see you again.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:08.630
QUICHE!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.110
You’re going to meet
your end this time.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:25.970
We have to transform!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:26.570
But…

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.490
Watch out!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.710
Brother!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.250
Minto, run away.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.330
Brother!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.210
Hurry up and transform!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.670
How could you… I’m your opponent!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:50.560
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:18.010
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:28.180
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:33.760
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:38.150
For the future of the earth…

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:40.390
At your service! ~Nya!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:57.240
1, 2, 3… 1, 2, 3…

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.260
I got it!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.790
I know your weakness.
Prepare yourself!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.230
Critical hit!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.280
Mew Mint!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.540
Why you!..

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.610
Wait!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:38.870
I’m okay.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.950
For hurting my dear brother…
I won’t forgive you!!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.380
Mint… Travail!

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:57.900
MintonArrow!!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.520
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:13.740
Mew Strawberry.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:14.780
We’ll help you.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:15.510
Yes!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.420
Yep!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:23.470
Reborn… PuddingRings…

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.580
INFERNO!!

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:32.630
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:35.270
StrawberBell!!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:52.940
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.940
Mew Mint, finish her!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:59.410
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:07.830
Retrieve!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.090
We did it!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:10.790
Yes!

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:11.840
Che!

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.050
It was fighting pretty well,
but oh well.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.510
I’ll bring a more powerful one next.

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:17.760
See you, Ichigo.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.820
Damn! Don’t ever come again!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:34.950
Oniisama, you shouldn’t be wasting your time here.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.780
You should leave.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:58.050
I wanted to see you perform today.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:02.050
You’re my important sister regardless if we’re separated, Minto.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.610
Oniisama!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:30.490
I wonder if the rumor about the pretty girl
who defeats monster at midnight refers to me.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.660
Ichigo, you’re being impudent.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:37.500
Because, my ears, tail, and the excellent body is just like the rumors!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.170
Your body is far from excellent.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.300
Hey, what do you mean by that!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.300
Just like I said!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.180
GRrrrr!!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:49.260
Next time: The Last Member,
The Legendary Lonely Wolf.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:52.320
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
